`benchmark.meta description: Repeats Point arithmetic, dot and cross products with varying coordinates.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: graphics,compile-timing

/core
/graphics/point
/graphics/primitives

. checksum = 0.0
for index in 0 .. < 5000000
    . point = Point((index % 97) as F64, (index % 61) as F64)
    . other = Point(point.x + 3, point.y - 2)
    . shifted = (point + other) - other
    . scaled = -(shifted * 2) / 2
    . adjusted = (scaled + Dimensions(2, 4) + 1) / Dimensions(1, 2)
    checksum += 100000 + adjusted.dot(other) + adjusted.cross(point)

-- "bench-result graphics/point-arithmetic-hot checksum=${checksum as Size}"
